summary: 700499 regression test
description: |+
    The printk output in __oom_kill_task no longer includes p->uid as it did in
    RHEL 5.  LLNL relies on this data point to be able to identify the user causing
    the oom_kill.  This allows them to address the infraction with the user.

contact: Petr Benas <pbenas@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - gcc
tier: 2
tag: [tier2]
duration: 10m
extra-summary: /kernel/memory/700499-oom-print-uid
extra-task: /kernel/memory/700499-oom-print-uid
